source: crates/roadbook-cli/tests/cli.rs
expression: text(&out.stdout)
---
## Publish

`spec/conformance/charts/task-emits.road:18`

```text
Uploads through an emitting task and shows its progress. Can pause, and upload again.
```

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
  Uploading: invoke upload(size) as up
  Uploading: on up.Progress / set percent = event.percent, do showProgress(event.percent)
  Published: output stored
  [*] --> Uploading
  Uploading --> Stored: done / set stored = stored + result
  Uploading --> Paused: Pause
  Paused --> Uploading: Resume
  Stored --> Uploading: Resume
  Stored --> Published: Finish
  Published --> [*]
```

## Eager

`spec/conformance/charts/task-emits.road:47`

```text
Moves on as soon as the upload says it is complete, without waiting for its outcome.
```

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
  Uploading: invoke upload(size) as up
  Uploading: on up.Progress [else] / set percent = event.percent
  Published: output stored
  [*] --> Uploading
  Uploading --> Stored: done / set stored = stored + result
  Uploading --> Stored: up.Progress [event.percent >= 100] / set percent = event.percent
  Stored --> Uploading: Again
  Stored --> Published: Finish
  Published --> [*]
```

## Quiet

`spec/conformance/charts/task-emits.road:76`

```text
Invokes `upload` twice: first with `as`, hearing only `Progress`, then without, hearing
nothing.
```

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
  Heard: invoke upload(size) as up
  Heard: on up.Progress / set stored = event.percent
  Unnamed: invoke upload(size)
  Over: output stored
  [*] --> Heard
  Heard --> Unnamed: done / set stored = result
  Unnamed --> Over: done / set stored = stored + result
  Over --> [*]
```

## Gauge

`spec/conformance/charts/task-emits.road:99`

```text
Keeps the highest percentage it has heard. It is strict, but a `Progress` whose guard
fails is dropped like any emitted event.
```

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
  Uploading: invoke upload(size) as up
  Uploading: on up.Progress [event.percent > percent] / set percent = event.percent
  Stored: output percent
  [*] --> Uploading
  Uploading --> Stored: done / set percent = result
  Stored --> [*]
```

## Nested

`spec/conformance/charts/task-emits.road:115`

```text
Hears `Progress` in whichever child state it is in. `-> .Second` keeps the upload running.
```

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
  state Working {
    state "First" as Working_First
    Working_First: on up.Progress / set percent = event.percent
    state "Second" as Working_Second
    Working_Second: on up.Progress / do showProgress(event.percent)
    [*] --> Working_First
  }
  note right of Working
    invoke upload(size) as up
  end note
  Finished: output percent
  [*] --> Working
  Working --> Finished: done / set percent = result
  Working --> Working_Second: Next
  Finished --> [*]
```

## Login

`spec/conformance/charts/task-emits.road:138`

```text
Signs in, keeping the name of the last step it heard.
```

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
  Signing: invoke signIn(user) as auth
  Signing: on auth.Step / set step = event.name
  Signed: output step
  [*] --> Signing
  Signing --> Signed: done / set step = result
  Signed --> [*]
```
